docs/api-reference/templates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/templates#templates-api","content":"Templates let you define reusable email layouts with dynamic variables. Use Handlebars-style `{{variable}}` syntax for personalization. Templates can be referenced by ID when sending emails, keeping your sending code clean and your email content centrally managed."},"1860":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-31","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/templates#templates-api","content":"Template import/render requests accept at most 8 MiB of JSON. Imported HTML/text fields and MJML source are limited to 1 MiB each; MJML compilation requests allow 2 MiB of JSON for encoding overhead. Imports accept up to 100 templates with up to 500 blocks each. MJML file includes are disabled. Read/preview operations require `templates:read`; imports and changes require `templates:write`. Oversized request bodies return HTTP 413."},"1861":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-32","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/templates#templates-api","content":"MJML compilation has a five-second deadline and 4 MiB output limit. If the compiler is busy, retry shortly; reduce large templates if they exceed resource limits."},"1862":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-33","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/templates#list-templates","content":"Retrieve all templates for your account."},"1863":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-34","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/templates#query-parameters","content":"| Parameter | Type    | Default | Description |\n| --------- | ------- | ------- | ----------- |\n| `page`    | integer | `1`     | Page number |","table":"table-0"},"1864":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/templates-35","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/templates","ta