i-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event            | Description                            | Trigger           |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `email.deferred` | Email temporarily rejected; will retry | 4xx SMTP response |","table":"table-0"},"1948":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-43","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event           | Description          | Trigger                                                        |\n| --------------- | -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `email.dropped` | Message was not sent | A batch or scheduled send failed, or a duplicate was discarded |","table":"table-0"},"1949":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-44","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event            | Description              | Trigger                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------------------- |\n| `email.received` | Inbound message received | Inbound mail to a hosted mailbox |","table":"table-0"},"1950":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-45","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event          | Description                               | Trigger               |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `email.opened` | A person opened the email (bots filtered) | Tracking pixel loaded |","table":"table-0"},"1951":{"id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks-46","page_id":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api-reference/webhooks#event-types","content":"| Event           | Description       