orthRelay | Record contains `include:_spf.north-pipe.ca` |","table":"table-0"},"2339":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-25","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#what-it-tests","content":"| Check           | Description                                                       | Pass Criteria                                    |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **DKIM Record** | Verifies the DKIM CNAME record points to NorthRelay's signing key | CNAME resolves to the expected NorthRelay target |","table":"table-0"},"2340":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-26","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#what-it-tests","content":"| Check            | Description                              | Pass Criteria                             |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **DMARC Record** | Checks for a DMARC policy on your domain | `_dmarc.yourdomain.com` TXT record exists |","table":"table-0"},"2341":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-27","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#what-it-tests","content":"| Check          | Description                                                  | Pass Criteria                |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| **MX Records** | Validates your domain's MX configuration (for inbox domains) | MX records resolve correctly |","table":"table-0"},"2342":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-28","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#what-it-tests","content":"| Check                 | Description                                                            | Pass Criteria                      |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **SMTP Connectivity** | Tests that NorthRelay can establish an SMTP connection for your domain | Connection succeeds within timeout |","table":"table-0"},"2343":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-29","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#what-it-tests","content":"| Check              | Description                                    | Pass Criteria                            |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Authentication** | Validates your API key and sending permissions | API key is valid and has send permission |","table":"table-0"},"2344":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-30","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#how-to-use","content":"Go to **Dashboard > Tools > Pre-Flight Check**"},"2345":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-31","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#how-to-use","content":"Enter the domain you want to test (must be added to your account)"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-32","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#how-to-use","content":"Click **Run Check**"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-33","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#how-to-use","content":"Review the results -- each check shows pass, fail, or warning with a specific message"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-34","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#interpreting-results","content":"**All green:** Your configuration is correct. You are ready to send."},"2349":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-35","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#interpreting-results","content":"**Yellow warnings:** Non-critical issues (e.g., DMARC policy is `none` instead of `reject`). Sending will work but deliverability may not be optimal."},"2350":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-36","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#interpreting-results","content":"**Red failures:** Critical issues that will prevent delivery or cause authentication failures. Fix these before sending."},"2351":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-37","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#interpreting-results","content":"Each failed check includes an **action** field explaining exactly what to fix and a link to the relevant documentation."},"2352":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-38","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#blocklist-monitor","content":"The Blocklist Monitor checks your domain and sending IPs against 13 industry-standard DNS-based Real-time Blocklists (RBLs). Being listed on a blocklist can severely impact your deliverability."},"2353":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-39","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#provider-coverage","content":"The monitor checks 13 consolidated providers organized into four tiers by importance:"},"2354":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-40","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#tier-1-industry-standard-3-providers","content":"These are the blocklists that major mailbox providers actively check. A listing here has the most impact."},"2355":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-41","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#tier-1-industry-standard-3-providers","content":"| Provider         | Type     | Description                                                                    |\n| ---------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Spamhaus ZEN** | IP-based | Combined Spamhaus blocklist (SBL + XBL + PBL). The most widely used blocklist. |","table":"table-1"},"2356":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-42","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#tier-1-industry-standard-3-providers","content":"| Provider      | Type     | Description                                                                  |\n| ------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Barracuda** | IP-based | Barracuda Networks reputation system. Used by many enterprise mail gateways. |","table":"table-1"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-43","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#tier-1-industry-standard-3-providers","content":"| Provider    | Type     | Description                                                           |\n| ----------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **SpamCop** | IP-based | Crowdsourced spam reporting. Listings are time-based and auto-expire. |","table":"table-1"},"2358":{"id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools-44","page_id":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/features/diagnostic-tools#tier-2-compromised-hosts--network-threats-6-providers","content":"These detect compromised systems, botnets, and ne