eshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#connection-timed-out","content":"Verify the hostname is exactly `smtp.north-pipe.ca` (not `smtp.northrelay.ca`)"},"2868":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#connection-timed-out","content":"Check that DNS resolution works: `nslookup smtp.north-pipe.ca`"},"2869":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#connection-timed-out","content":"Some cloud providers (AWS, GCP) restrict outbound SMTP by default. You may need to request SMTP access or use an alternative port."},"2870":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#tls-handshake-failure","content":"Ensure your client supports TLS 1.2 or later"},"2871":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#tls-handshake-failure","content":"Use STARTTLS on port 587 (not raw TLS)"},"2872":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#tls-handshake-failure","content":"For port 465, use implicit TLS (your client should connect with TLS directly)"},"2873":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#tls-handshake-failure","content":"Test the TLS connection manually:"},"2874":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#535-authentication-failed","content":"Your credentials are incorrect. Double-check:"},"2875":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#535-authentication-failed","content":"**Username** must be your full NorthRelay account email (e.g., `you@example.com`), not a custom domain address"},"2876":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#535-authentication-failed","content":"**Password** must be a valid API key starting with `nr_live_`"},"2877":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#535-authentication-failed","content":"The API key must be active — check **Dashboard → API Keys** to confirm it has not been revoked"},"2878":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#535-authentication-failed","content":"Copy the API key again; whitespace or trailing characters can cause failures"},"2879":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#553-authentication-required","content":"You are trying to send without authenticating first. Ensure your SMTP client is configured to use authentication with LOGIN or PLAIN mechanism."},"2880":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#api-key-format-invalid","content":"API keys follow the format `nr_live_xxxxxxxxxxxx`. If your key does not start with `nr_live_`, it may be a test key