-0"},"2909":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-70","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#451-471-rate-limit-exceeded","content":"To increase your quota, upgrade your plan at **Dashboard → Billing**."},"2910":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-71","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#temporary-rate-limiting-421","content":"A `421` response means the server is temporarily throttling your connection. This can happen during high-volume sends."},"2911":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-72","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#temporary-rate-limiting-421","content":"Wait 30-60 seconds and retry"},"2912":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-73","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#temporary-rate-limiting-421","content":"Implement exponential backoff in your application"},"2913":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-74","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#temporary-rate-limiting-421","content":"Spread large sends over a longer time window"},"2914":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-75","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#spam-content-detected","content":"NorthRelay scans outbound email for content that may trigger spam filters. If your email is rejected:"},"2915":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-76","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#spam-content-detected","content":"Avoid excessive use of ALL CAPS, exclamation marks, and spam trigger words"},"2916":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-77","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#spam-content-detected","content":"Ensure the HTML-to-text ratio is reasonable (include a plain text version)"},"2917":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-78","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#spam-content-detected","content":"Do not use URL shorteners in email body"},"2918":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-79","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#blocked-recipient-suppression-list","content":"If a recipient previously bounced or marked your email as spam, they may be on your suppression list."},"2919":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-80","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#blocked-recipient-suppression-list","content":"Check the suppression list in **Dashboard → Email Logs → Suppressions**"},"2920":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-81","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#blocked-recipient-suppression-list","content":"Remove the address from the suppression list if you believe the issue is resolved"},"2921":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-82","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#blocked-recipient-suppression-list","content":"Re-sending to suppressed addresses without removing them first will result in a silent drop"},"2922":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-83","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#diagnostic-tools","content":"NorthRelay provides built-in tools to diagnose sending issues:"},"2923":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-84","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#diagnostic-tools","content":"| Tool                 | Location                             | Purpose                                                                          |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Pre-Flight Check** | Dashboard → Tools → Pre-Flight Check | Validates DNS records, authentication, and sending configuration before you send |","table":"table-1"},"2924":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-85","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#diagnostic-tools","content":"| Tool                  | Location                      | Purpose                                                                      |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Blocklist Monitor** | Dashboard → Tools → Blocklist | Checks your sending IPs against 13 industry-standard DNS blocklist providers |","table":"table-1"},"2925":{"id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting-86","page_id":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/getting-started/troubleshooting#diagnostic-tools","content":"| Tool                    | Location                         | Purpose                                                                 |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Connectivity Doctor** | Dashboard → Tools → Connectivity | Tests SMTP connectivity and TLS configuration from NorthRelay's servers |","table":"table-1"},"2926":