tion_status`, which returns his lists, topics, consent evidence and any suppression."},"4005":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-117","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#mailing-lists-and-subscriptions","content":"> \"Unsubscribe bob@example.com from product updates only.\""},"4006":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-118","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#mailing-lists-and-subscriptions","content":"The agent calls `unsubscribe_contact` with `scope: \"topic\"`. Someone who unsubscribed is never re-added unless you explicitly confirm fresh consent (`resubscribe`)."},"4007":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-119","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#mailing-lists-and-subscriptions","content":"> \"Add these five addresses to the 'Beta testers' list, creating contacts that don't exist yet.\""},"4008":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-120","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#mailing-lists-and-subscriptions","content":"The agent calls `add_list_members` with `emails` and `createMissing`; unsubscribed or suppressed addresses come back in `blocked`."},"4009":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-121","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#mailing-lists-and-subscriptions","content":"> \"Who on the 'Beta testers' list would not receive a campaign, and why?\""},"4010":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-122","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#mailing-lists-and-subscriptions","content":"The agent calls `list_list_members` with `filter: \"suppressed\"`; each member carries its `suppressionStatuses`."},"4011":{"id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server-123","page_id":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/mcp-server#mailing-lists-and-subscriptions","content":"See the Subscriptions API for the underlying endp