ing","content":"| Exception    | When                                                              | Extra attributes |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `ScopeError` | 403, including `SCOPE_INSUFFICIENT` and `FREE_TIER_CONTACT_LIMIT` | —                |","table":"table-4"},"4099":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-70","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#error-handling","content":"| Exception         | When | Extra attributes |\n| ----------------- | ---- | ---------------- |\n| `ValidationError` | 400  | `errors`         |","table":"table-4"},"4100":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-71","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#error-handling","content":"| Exception       | When                                                                    | Extra attributes |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `NotFoundError` | 404, including `LIST_NOT_FOUND`, `TOPIC_NOT_FOUND`, `CONTACT_NOT_FOUND` | —                |","table":"table-4"},"4101":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-72","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#error-handling","content":"| Exception            | When                         | Extra attributes            |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `QuotaExceededError` | Monthly quota exceeded (429) | `quota_limit`, `quota_used` |","table":"table-4"},"4102":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-73","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#error-handling","content":"| Exception        | When                      | Extra attributes |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `RateLimitError` | Rate limit exceeded (429) | `retry_after`    |","table":"table-4"},"4103":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-74","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#error-handling","content":"| Exception     | When | Extra attributes |\n| ------------- | ---- | ---------------- |\n| `ServerError` | 5xx  | —                |","table":"table-4"},"4104":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-75","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#error-handling","content":"| Exception      | When                              | Extra attributes |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `NetworkError` | The request did not reach the API | —                |","table":"table-4"},"4105":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-76","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#error-handling","content":"| Exception         | When                                                                                                                           | Extra attributes         |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------ |\n| `NorthRelayError` | Any other status, including 409 `RECIPIENT_UNSUBSCRIBED`, `RECIPIENT_SUPPRESSED`, `CONTACT_BLOCKED`, `NO_PENDING_CONFIRMATION` | `status_code`, `details` |","table":"table-4"},"4106":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-77","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#automatic-retries","content":"Reads are retried on `ServerError`, `NetworkError` and `RateLimitError` with a `retry_after`, using exponential backoff from `retry_delay` capped at `max_retry_delay` (or the `retry_after` value). Writes to contacts, lists, subscriptions, topics, forms and webhooks are not retried automatically."},"4107":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-78","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#webhook-verification","content":"NorthRelay signs each delivery with HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body, hex-encoded, in the `X-NorthRelay-Signature` header. Verify it with the standard library, then parse the body into the SDK's `WebhookPayload` model:"},"4108":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-79","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#related","content":"TypeScript SDK"},"4109":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-80","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#related","content":"MCP Server for AI agent integration"},"4110":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-81","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#related","content":"Mailing Lists guide"},"4111":{"id":"/docs/sdks/python-82","page_id":"/docs/sdks/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/python#related","content":"API Reference for raw HTTP API details"},"4112":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","type":"page","content":"TypeScript SDK","breadcrumbs":["NorthRelay Documentation","SDKs"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdks/typescript"},"4113":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-0","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript","content":"Official NorthRelay TypeScript/Node.js client library for sending email, managing contacts, mailing lists and subscriptions, and verifying webhooks"},"4114":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-1","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#typescript-sdk","content":"TypeScript SDK"},"4115":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-2","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#installation","content":"Installation"},"4116":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-3","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#quick-start","content":"Quick Start"},"4117":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-4","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#configuration","content":"Configuration"},"4118":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescr