      | Description                                     |\n| --------- | -------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `baseUrl` | `string` | `https://app.northrelay.ca` | API base URL (HTTPS, no credentials in the URL) |","table":"table-0"},"4138":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-25","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#configuration","content":"| Option    | Type     | Default | Description                     |\n| --------- | -------- | ------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `timeout` | `number` | `30000` | Request timeout in milliseconds |","table":"table-0"},"4139":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-26","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#configuration","content":"| Option       | Type     | Default | Description                               |\n| ------------ | -------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `maxRetries` | `number` | `3`     | Max retry attempts for retryable failures |","table":"table-0"},"4140":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-27","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#configuration","content":"| Option       | Type     | Default | Description                                |\n| ------------ | -------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `retryDelay` | `number` | `1000`  | Base delay between retries in milliseconds |","table":"table-0"},"4141":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-28","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#responses","content":"Most methods resolve to the API's response envelope, `{ success: true, data }`, so read results from `data`:"},"4142":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-29","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#responses","content":"Contact-list routes return `{ data }` (and `pagination` for lists), and `importCsv` returns the import result directly. The return type of every method says which shape you get."},"4143":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-30","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#mailing-lists-and-subscriptions","content":"See the Mailing Lists guide for the full integration and the Subscriptions API for request and response details."},"4144":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-31","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"| Method                             | Endpoint              | Returns `data`    |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `subscriptions.subscribe(request)` | `POST /subscriptions` | `SubscribeResult` |","table":"table-1"},"4145":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-32","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"| Method                               | Endpoint                          | Returns `data`      |\n| ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `subscriptions.unsubscribe(request)` | `POST /subscriptions/unsubscribe` | `UnsubscribeResult` |","table":"table-1"},"4146":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-33","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"| Method                     | Endpoint                     | Returns `data`       |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `subscriptions.get(email)` | `GET /subscriptions/{email}` | `SubscriptionStatus` |","table":"table-1"},"4147":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-34","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"| Method                                            | Endpoint                       | Returns `data`       |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | -------------------- |\n| `subscriptions.updatePreferences(email, request)` | `PATCH /subscriptions/{email}` | `SubscriptionStatus` |","table":"table-1"},"4148":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-35","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"| Method                                    | Endpoint                                          | Returns `data`             |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `subscriptions.resendConfirmation(email)` | `POST /subscriptions/{email}/resend-confirmation` | `ResendConfirmationResult` |","table":"table-1"},"4149":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-36","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#subscriptions","content":"Emails are URL-encoded in paths for you. `isSubscriptionError(error, code?)` returns `true` for a `NorthRelayError` whose `code` is one of `LIST_NOT_FOUND`, `TOPIC_NOT_FOUND`, `CONTACT_NOT_FOUND`, `CONTACT_BLOCKED`, `RECIPIENT_SUPPRESSED`, `RECIPIENT_UNSUBSCRIBED`, `NO_PENDING_CONFIRMATION`, `FREE_TIER_CONTACT_LIMIT` or `VALIDATION_ERROR` (optionally a specific one). `subscribe` and `resendConfirmation` are never retried automatically, because a retry could send a second confirmation email."},"4150":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-37","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#contacts","content":"`contacts.list()` filters by `status`, `tag`, `search`, `source`, `sortBy` and `sortOrder`. It does not filter by list; use `getListMembers(listId)`. `contacts.create()` does not record consent or fire webhooks; use `subscriptions.subscribe()` when a person signs up."},"4151":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-38","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                          | Endpoint              |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `contacts.listLists({ page, limit, type, isArchived, search })` | `GET /contacts/lists` |","table":"table-2"},"4152":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-39","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                                                        | Endpoint                                 |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `contacts.getList(id)` / `createList(request)` / `updateList(id, request)` / `deleteList(id)` | `/contacts/lists/{id}` (delete archives) |","table":"table-2"},"4153":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-40","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                 | Endpoint                           |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `contacts.getListMembers(id, { page, limit, filter })` | `GET /contacts/lists/{id}/members` |","table":"table-2"},"4154":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-41","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                                  | Endpoint                            |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `contacts.addListMembers(id, { contactIds?, emails?, createMissing? })` | `POST /contacts/lists/{id}/members` |","table":"table-2"},"4155":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-42","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                     | Endpoint                              |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `contacts.removeListMembers(id, { contactIds?, emails? })` | `DELETE /contacts/lists/{id}/members` |","table":"table-2"},"4156":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-43","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"| Method                                                                                | Endpoint                                       |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `contacts.addToList(id, contactIdsOrInput)` / `removeFromList(id, contactIdsOrInput)` | Shorthands that accept an array of contact ids |","table":"table-2"},"4157":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-44","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#lists-and-members","content":"`removeListMembers` is the list owner removing someone (the membership is deleted). To record that a recipient asked to leave, use `subscriptions.unsubscribe({ email, scope: 'list', listId })`."},"4158":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-45","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#csv-import","content":"`importCsv` accepts a `Blob`/`File` or the CSV text. `mappings` is required."},"4159":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-46","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#topics-suppression-groups","content":"A topic member is an address that **opted out** of that topic."},"4160":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-47","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#topics-suppression-groups","content":"The member methods only edit the opt-out rows. For a recipient's own choice, prefer `subscriptions.unsubscribe({ scope: 'topic', topicId })` or `updatePreferences`, which also update tagged lists and fire webhooks. `bulkAddSuppressions(id, emails)` and `bulkRemoveSuppressions(id, emails)` change up to 10,000 opt-outs at once."},"4161":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-48","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#signup-forms","content":"`forms.submit(id, values)` posts answers keyed by `fieldKey` to a published form. From your own backend, `subscriptions.subscribe()` is usually the better choice."},"4162":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-49","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#webhooks","content":"The webhook routes return their own shapes rather than the `{ success, data }` envelope, as shown above. `create` is not retried automatically. After `rotateSecret`, deliveries also carry `X-NorthRelay-Signature-Previous` (signed with the old secret) until `previousSecretValidUntil`, one hour later. `events` is typed as `WebhookEventType[]`. See Webhook verification for the receiving side."},"4163":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-50","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#suppressions","content":"`reason` is one of `Bounce`, `Complaint`, `Unsubscribe` or `Manual`. To record a recipient's own opt-out, prefer `subscriptions.unsubscribe()`."},"4164":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-51","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#templates-and-brands-studio","content":"Every template is a Studio design. Your dashboard templates use the application key `\"account\"` (`ACCOUNT_APPLICATION`); a product with an `nr_app_` credential uses its own key."},"4165":{"id":"/docs/sdks/typescript-52","page_id":"/docs/sdks/typescript","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/sdks/typescript#templates-and-brands-studio","content":"`templates` and `brandTheme` are deprecate