d complaint suppression"],[2386,"**Barracuda:** https://www.barracudacentral.org/lookups"],[2288,"**Best for:** Agencies, multi-brand senders and marketing teams."],[2254,"**Best for:** Developers evaluating NorthRelay, personal projects, proof-of-concept integrations."],[2279,"**Best for:** SaaS products, growing businesses, anyone who needs deliverability guarantees."],[2269,"**Best for:** Small businesses and newsletters that send both transactional and marketing mail."],[2261,"**Best for:** Solo developers and small sites that want transactional email and a mailbox on their own domain."],[2695,"**Bounce and complaint suppression** — hard bounces and spam complaints are added to your suppression list automatically and never mailed again."],[2570,"**Bounce Rate** -- with threshold indicator"],[3517,"**Caching** - Session data, DNS lookup caching"],[3112,"**Campaigns:** put `{{unsubscribe_url}}` in your template footer. NorthRelay adds the `List-Unsubscribe` and `List-Unsubscribe-Post: List-Unsubscribe=One-Click` headers to every message."],[2273,"**Catch-all** inbox on your domains"],[2509,"**Cause:** The `_northrelay-verify` TXT record is missing or has the wrong value."],[2504,"**Cause:** The CNAME record for `default._domainkey` is missing or pointing to the wrong value."],[2498,"**Cause:** The SPF TXT record has not propagated or contains a syntax error."],[2601,"**Check for infrastructure issues.** Use the Connectivity Doctor to verify SMTP connectivity."],[2599,"**Check for new incidents.** The incidents panel will tell you which metric triggered the drop."],[2597,"**Check the Blocklist Monitor.** Your IP or domain may be listed on a blocklist."],[2595,"**Check your DNS configuration.** Use the Pre-Flight Check to validate SPF, DKIM, and DMARC records."],[3945,"**claude.ai and Claude Desktop custom connectors.** The *Add custom\nconnector* dialog reaches a remote MCP server and authenticates by OAuth —\nthere is no field for a bearer token. A hosted instance