`, `messageId` and `recipient`. The same event may be delivered more than once, and a contact change can arrive before or after a related `list.*` event; read the current state with `GET /subscriptions/{email}` when order matters."],[2593,"**Honor unsubscribes immediately.** Process opt-outs within the same sending cycle."],[2243,"**Hosted in Canada, billed in CAD.** Relay, mailbox and dashboard run on Canadian servers."],[2696,"**Hourly delivery canary** — every hour NorthRelay sends a real message through the full sending path to a monitored mailbox and checks that it arrives with SPF, DKIM and DMARC passing. If it fails or goes stale, our team is alerted."],[2248,"**Hourly delivery canary** that sends a real message through the relay and reads back its SPF, DKIM and DMARC verdicts."],[2382,"**Identify the cause.** Review your Reputation Monitoring dashboard for incidents."],[2591,"**Include a visible unsubscribe link.** Make it easy to opt out -- this reduces complaints."],[2604,"**Keep bounce rate under 2%.** This is the industry standard for healthy sending."],[2605,"**Keep complaint rate under 0.08%.** Gmail's threshold for filtering is 0.1%."],[3770,"**latest handshake:** Should be within the last 2 minutes. If blank or old, the tunnel is down."],[3069,"**Lists or topics?** Use a list for \"who do I send this to\" and a topic for \"what kind of mail is this\". A common setup is one topic per kind of mail, and each list tagged with its topic. Then:"],[2043,"**Log failures.** Monitor your webhook endpoint health in the dashboard."],[3943,"**macOS:** `~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json`\n**Windows:** `%APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json`\n**Linux:** `~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json`"],[128,"**Monitor key usage.** Review API key activity in Dashboard > Settings > API Keys to detect unauthorized use."],[2603,"**Monitor your dashboard weekly.** Catch trends before they become incidents."],[2829,"**Monitored every hour** - a delivery canary confirms mail is arriving with SPF, DKIM and DMARC passing"],[3410,"**Monitored every hour** — a delivery canary confirms mail is landing with SPF, DKIM and DMARC passing"],[3951,"**Name:** `northrelay`"],[2478,"**Namecheap:** Advanced DNS > Add New Record"],[122,"**Never commit API keys to version control.** Store them in environment variables or a secrets manager."],[2030,"**Notify** sends one email per streak when the consecutive failures reach the threshold (default 5), to up to five addresses or, when none is set, to the account owner."],[2245,"**One clean, monitored sending IP.** Only verified sender domains can send; campaigns carry one-click unsubscribe; bounces and complaints are suppressed automatically."],[2694,"**One-click unsubscribe** — every marketing and campaign message carries RFC 8058 `List-Unsubscribe` headers, so recipients can opt out with one click instead of reporting spam."],[2590,"**Only send to opted-in recipients.** Never purchase email lists."],[2876,"**Password** must be a valid API key starting with `nr_live_`"],[3256,"**Password**: An active API key from **Dashboard → API Keys** (e.g., `nr_live_xxxxxxxxxxxx`)"],[3113,"**Preference link:** put `{{preferences_url}}` next to it to give recipients a signed link to NorthRelay's hosted preference centre, where they can choose topics or unsubscribe from everything."],[3518,"**Queues** - Background job processing"],[3516,"**Rate limiting** - Per-user SMTP send rate enforcement"],[2388,"**Re-check.** After delisting, run the Blocklist Monitor again to confirm."],[2350,"**Red failures:** Critical issues that will prevent delivery or cause authentication failures. Fix these before sending."],[2598,"**Reduce sending volume temporarily.** If you are being throttled, slow down and gradually ramp back up."],[2589,"**Remove inactive subscribers.** Contacts who have not engaged in 6+ months are more likely to become invalid."],[2384,"**Request delisting.** Each blocklist prov